== Acceptance criteria ==

Wave 3 is ready to leave Phase 3 when:

# all 51 surfaces remain present;
# one concept = one Core semantic identity;
# controlled Domains pass, including the new Linguistics Domain;
# Linguistics category, portal and [[Language]] exemplar all exist;
# public/project distinctions remain explicit;
# all depth derivatives remain category/identity-exempt;
# disambiguated slash/parenthesized title deployment remains valid;
# <code>validate_v2.py</code> passes;
# runtime-schema, substrate, workflow and Main-space audits pass;
# staging builds the complete graph.

